Description: transactional KDE Plasma 6 ricing workbench
 Alchemy inspects reviewed KDE Plasma appearance settings, previews changes,
 snapshots affected files, journals mutations, verifies results, and supports
 rollback. Rice manifests contain declarative configuration rather than scripts.
